    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Excellent detached two storey property built in 2005 and standing on a large corner site. The property has oil fired heating, double glazed windows and Palladio front door and is in pristine condition throughout.\r\nThere is a large cobble lock driveway to the front and side access to rear enclosed garden with large, detached shed.\r\nLarge green are to the front of the property It is within walking distance of all town centre amenities and just 5 minutes to junction 10 & 11 of the M8 motorway and 10 minutes to Clonmel."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall with carpet floor and stairs \r\nKitchen fully fitted with double doors leading to dining room 3 x 6m\r\nDining room with patio doors leading to garden 4.2 x 2.9m\r\nSitting room with carpet floor and solid fuel stove 3.5 x 4.9m\r\nUtility room fitted and plumbed for washing machine & dryer\r\nWC under stairs\r\nBedroom one/ office with carpet floor\r\nFirst floor-\r\nBedroom two with carpet floor and access to bathroom 5.3 x 2.6\r\nBathroom fully tiled 3 x 2m\r\nBedroom three master with fitted robes 5.7 x 3.5 and en suite\r\nLarge rear enclosed landscaped garden with patio area and large detached shed. Early viewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large cobble lock driveway with side entrance to large rear enclosed garde, patio area and detached hbby shed\r\nDetached property\r\nOil fired heating & double glazed windows and hardwood doors\r\nwalking distance of all town ammenities\r\nJust 5 mins drive to junctions 10 & 11 of the M8 motorway\r\nClonmel 15 mins, Cork 50 mins and Limerick/ Waterford 1 hour\r\nEasy walking distance to Cahir Castle, Inch field and coronation walk to the scenic Swiss cottage\r\nCahir park Golf club, Cahir park FC and Gaa all  within 5 mins drive."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Cahir take the Clonmel road and take  the last left turn  in through Butler Court, at the roundabout take the 3rd Exit and the property is the first on the right."
      }
    ],
